---
---

<section data-fast-scroll="scroll_to_skills" class="box skills">
	<div class="stack gap-2">
		<div class="metric">+137%</div>
		<h2>Engineering output</h2>
		<p>Redesigned delivery at an HR fintech. 13 engineers, 3 teams, roadmap aligned with the business.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2">
		<div class="metric">24</div>
		<h2>Engineers led</h2>
		<p>Four squads on an enterprise product, from strategy through production.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2">
		<div class="metric">Sold</div>
		<h2>To Factorial</h2>
		<p>Found a gap in their Italian market, built the integration, and sold them the product.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2">
		<div class="metric">20%</div>
		<h2>Market share</h2>
		<p>FX share captured through automation at Argentina's largest retail broker.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.box {
		border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background-color: var(--gray-999_40);
	}

	.skills {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 2rem 1.5rem;
	}

	.skills h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: var(--text-md);
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0;
	}

	.skills p {
		color: var(--gray-300);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
	}

	.metric {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 2.25rem;
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--gray-0);
		line-height: 1;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		box-shadow: inset 0 -0.35rem 0 var(--accent-regular);
		width: fit-content;
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.box {
			border-radius: 1.5rem;
			padding: 2.5rem;
		}

		.skills {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
			gap: 2rem;
		}

		.metric {
			font-size: 2.75rem;
		}
	}
</style>
